type: software
title: "SR Data Extraction Plugin"
abstract: "A Chrome extension that supports data extraction in systematic reviews: AI-assisted extraction with verbatim quotes, highlighting of the supporting passages in the PDF, human verification of every value with an audit trail, and independent dual review, using Google Sheets as the database."
